							<string name="Text"><![CDATA[This experience contains flashing lights, rapidly changing colors, and bright visual effects that may trigger seizures or other reactions in people with photosensitive epilepsy or similar conditions.
 
If you or someone near you is prone to seizures or has been diagnosed with photosensitive epilepsy, please read the following before continuing:
 
• Avoid playing in a dark room or with screen brightness set very high
• If you begin to feel dizzy, experience eye strain, or notice any unusual discomfort, stop playing immediately
• Consult a doctor before playing if you are unsure whether these effects may affect you
 
You can disable flashing effects using the button below. This will turn off most rapid visual changes without affecting gameplay. You can change this setting at any time from the settings menu.]]></string>
